{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以西結書","commonName":"以西結書","title":"以西結書","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"12baf83f738d213fc8fcfdfb80ed9077bac361d38fc0165824d98cb7b59e53b9","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1270},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝選召以西結作先知"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["他對我說：「人子啊，你站起來，我要和你說話。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他對我說話的時候，靈就進入我裏面，使我站起來，我便聽見那位對我說話的聲音。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他對我說：「人子啊，我差你往悖逆的國民以色列人那裏去。他們是悖逆我的，他們和他們的列祖違背我，直到今日。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["這眾子面無羞恥，心裏剛硬。我差你往他們那裏去，你要對他們說：主耶和華如此說。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他們或聽，或不聽，（他們是悖逆之家），必知道在他們中間有了先知。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["人子啊，雖有荊棘和蒺藜在你那裏，你又住在蠍子中間，總不要怕他們，也不要怕他們的話；他們雖是悖逆之家，還不要怕他們的話，也不要因他們的臉色驚惶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他們或聽，或不聽，你只管將我的話告訴他們；他們是極其悖逆的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["「人子啊，要聽我對你所說的話，不要悖逆像那悖逆之家，你要開口吃我所賜給你的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我觀看，見有一隻手向我伸出來，手中有一書卷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他將書卷在我面前展開，內外都寫着字，其上所寫的有哀號、歎息、悲痛的話。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}